sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant App as Browser app
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant User as User Service

    U->>App: /signup
    App->>GW: POST /api/v1/user/signup
    GW->>User: public route, no token check
    User-->>App: 201, OTP emailed
    U->>App: /verify-email, six-digit code
    App->>GW: POST /api/v1/user/verify-email
    GW->>User: public route
    User-->>App: 200
    U->>App: /login
    App->>GW: POST /api/v1/user/login
    GW->>User: public route
    User-->>App: token
    Note over App: token kept in memory and sessionStorage foc.token
    App->>GW: GET /api/v1/user/me, Authorization Bearer token
    GW->>User: authorize, then forward
    User-->>App: id, name, status, isAdmin
    alt status Created
        App->>App: RequireVerified sends to /verify-telegram
        App->>GW: POST /api/v1/user/request-telegram-verification
        U->>App: code sent by the Telegram bot
        App->>GW: POST /api/v1/user/verify-telegram
        GW->>User: authorize, then forward
        User-->>App: status Verified
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/user/me again
    end
    App-->>U: /browse
    Note over App,GW: any later 401 clears the token and returns to /login
